  "cards": [
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Primary path: lesson to server", "items": [
      "LessonViewModel calls completeLesson when the last question finishes (LessonViewModel.java:94-98)",
      "ProgressRepository runs the write on the disk executor, off the UI thread (ProgressRepository.java:110-118)",
      "Room is the store the UI reads; MySQL is the long-term store per its own docs (AppDatabase.java:31-34)",
      "SyncRepository pushes progress, retention, weaknesses and AI memories, then pulls and merges (SyncRepository.java:40-59)",
      "Conflicts resolve last-write-wins per row on updated_at (SyncRepository.java:61-83)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Trust boundaries", "items": [
      "Device region holds every Room row, the user id and any Gemini key; only three edges leave it: sign in, generate and push / pull",
      "Gemini key: a value typed in Settings is kept in SharedPreferences (AppPreferences.java:79-85); otherwise it is compiled in from local.properties (app/build.gradle:31)",
      "Sync sends userId as a query parameter and sets no auth header (ApiService.java:15-19); server-side auth is not in this repo",
      "Gemini key travels in the x-goog-api-key header, not in the URL (GeminiApi.java:9-13)",
      "Guest accounts skip sync, so guest data never leaves the device (SyncWorker.java:40-41)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "External dependencies", "items": [
      "Google Gemini REST at generativelanguage.googleapis.com (NetworkModule.java:25)",
      "Firebase Auth and Google Sign-In: optional, needs app/google-services.json (AuthRepository.java:24-27)",
      "MySQL server: base URL from api.base.url, placeholder .invalid by default (app/build.gradle:33); server code is not in this repo",
      "Android OS: WorkManager, exact AlarmManager alarms for reminders (ReminderScheduler.java:25-39)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "violet", "title": "Background work and permissions", "items": [
      "SyncScheduler enqueues a 6-hour periodic sync that needs a network, started from MasterEnglishApp.onCreate (MasterEnglishApp.java:35)",
      "Reminder alarms are re-armed by AlarmReceiver and BootReceiver after a reboot",
      "Declared permissions include INTERNET, RECORD_AUDIO, POST_NOTIFICATIONS and SCHEDULE_EXACT_ALARM (AndroidManifest.xml:5-11)"
    ] },
    { "dot": "slate", "title": "Scope of this view", "items": [
